{"version":1,"id":"pinkpantheress-pain","title":"Pain","artist":"PinkPantheress","key":"Eb","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/pinkpantheress/pain/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Michael Stewart Powell, Martin Green and Pinkpantheress","chords":[{"symbol":"Abmaj7","canonical":"Abmaj7","keyboardPitchClasses":[8,0,3,7],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Ebmaj7","canonical":"Ebmaj7","keyboardPitchClasses":[3,7,10,2],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Dbmaj7","canonical":"Dbmaj7","keyboardPitchClasses":[1,5,8,0],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"lyric","text":"It's eight o'clock in the morning, now I'm entering my bed","columns":61,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Abmaj7","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Ebmaj7","column":26,"beat":2},{"symbol":"Abmaj7","column":55,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":"Had a few dreams about you, I can't tell you what we did","columns":59,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Ebmaj7","column":22,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Abmaj7","column":53,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"I expected to see ya on your morning run again","columns":48,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Ebmaj7","column":18,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Abmaj7","column":42,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"I know I shouldn't be watching 'cause every time I feel the pain","columns":66,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Ebmaj7","column":23,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Abmaj7","column":60,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"La, la-la-la-la, la-la","columns":22,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Abmaj7","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"La-la, la-la, la-la","columns":19,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Ebmaj7","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"La, la-la-la-la, la-la","columns":22,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Abmaj7","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"La-la, la-la, la-la","columns":19,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Ebmaj7","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"section","text":"[Verse 2]","columns":9,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"You told me it wasn't over and that we'd be together soon","columns":59,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Abmaj7","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Ebmaj7","column":22,"beat":2},{"symbol":"Abmaj7","column":53,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"But was this before or after you told me to leave your room?","columns":61,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Ebmaj7","column":23,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Abmaj7","column":55,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"I used to think we'd make it far, it turned out that we are","columns":62,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Ebmaj7","column":29,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Abmaj7","column":56,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"It's such a shame that we weren't the same at all","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Ebmaj7","column":23,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Abmaj7","column":46,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"La, la-la-la-la, la-la","columns":22,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Abmaj7","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"La-la, la-la, la-la","columns":19,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Ebmaj7","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"La, la-la-la-la, la-la","columns":22,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Abmaj7","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"La-la, la-la, la-la","columns":19,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Ebmaj7","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"La, la-la-la-la, la-la","columns":22,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Abmaj7","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"La-la, la-la, la-la","columns":19,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Ebmaj7","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"La, la-la-la-la